WeKnora attribution

The per-page PDF scan routing and process-wide PDFium lock in
src/studyhub_agent/knowledge/parsing.py are adapted from Tencent/WeKnora:
https://github.com/Tencent/WeKnora/blob/cf7aabeaca98f5b33d2f26efc1713d45c32cd401/docreader/parser/pdf_parser.py

Other knowledge and Wiki components reference the designs identified in
docs/specs/2026-10-16-rag-wiki-guard-alignment.md; they are not a copy of the
complete WeKnora service or its third-party dependencies.

